ABOUT THIS REPOSITORY

These write-ups are original prose. They are written from publicly
documented sources - published papers, official project documentation,
and the public source code of the systems described - and they explain
how those algorithms and systems work rather than reproducing anyone
else's text, figures, or code.

All diagrams in this repository are hand-authored SVG, original to this
project. No third-party images, embeds, or media files are used.

Code snippets are illustrative. Where they show a well-known algorithm
(for example path halving in union-find), they are the standard textbook
formulation of that algorithm, written out here in the plainest form
that makes the idea clear.

